From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Niall Smart <niall.smart@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 11 Sep 2026 08:31:19 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 11/13] dt-bindings: document Hi3531 platform interfaces

Document the board and SoC identity, the secondary-CPU enable method and the
Hi3531-specific system controller, UART clock mux, AHCI and USB PHY nodes.
These contracts cover every local compatible used by the maintained device
trees; the DWMAC binding is supplied with its glue driver.
---
